<div id="urduTextPath">عون و محمد (ع)/اُمت پہ پسر اپنے فدا کرتی ہے زینب</div>
<br>Ummat pe pisar apne fida karti hai Zainab,<br>
Seene se dil o jaa'n ko juda karti hai Zainab,<br>
Chut'te hain pisar shukre Khuda karti hai Zainab,<br>
Jo sabr ka haq hai wo ada karti hai Zainab<br>
<br>
Ghodou'n pe jo wo dono pur armaan chade hain,<br>
Maa kehti hai bete mere parwan chade hain.<br>
____________________________<br>
Sheh kehte hain humsheer ye kya karti hai dekho,<br>
Akber ko mere bhejo unhe ran me na bhejo,<br>
Wo kehti hai sadqe gayi tum isme na bolo,<br>
Zainab ne isi din ke liye paala tha inko.<br>
<br>
Tum to inhe ran me nahi bhijwate ho bhai,<br>
Phir kis liye humsheer se sharmate ho bhai.<br>
____________________________<br>
Bhijwane ka Akber ke na tum naam lo Bhaiyya,<br>
Akber ki bala inko lage wo rahe jeeta,<br>
Awwal to wo humshakle Nabi husn mein yekta,<br>
Aur dusre Zainab ko hai sehre ki tamanna.<br>
<br>
Asaan mujhe betou ka daagh aye Shahe dee'n hai,<br>
Inme koi atthara baras ka toh nahi hai.<br>
____________________________<br>
Lashkar ki safe'n cheer ke Dariya pe chale aaye,<br>
Lehrate huwe dekh ke pani ko kaha jaye,<br>
Kyu mashk Sakina ki na kandhe pe utha laye,<br>
Kisse kahe jo mashk hume qaime se de jaye.<br>
<br>
Hatif ne nida di ke abas ranjo qalaq hai,<br>
Saqqayi Sakina ki to Abbas ka haq hai.<br>
____________________________<br>
Zainab ne dare qaime se maida'n ko jo dekha,<br>
Paya na kahi betou ko ghabrayi wo dukhiya,<br>
Fizza se kaha bete mere qaid hue kya,<br>
Woh boli ke kuch sunti ho kya kehte hai adaa.<br>
<br>
Lashkar ki safe'n cheer ke do roz ke pyase <br>
Dariya pe gaye Saqiye Kausar ke nawase.<br>
____________________________<br>
Zainab ne kaha kyu gaye Dariya pe gharaz kya,<br>
Pee lenge jo pani toh ghazab aur bhi hoga,<br>
Bhai hai mera teen shabo roz ka pyasa,<br>
Fizza unhe awaaz de ye dhiyan hai beja'n<br>
<br>
Ek boond bhi pani ki kare nosh to sam hai,<br>
Ek dhaar na mai doodh ki baqshungi qasam hai.<br>
____________________________<br>
Gar peeliya pani to bas ab ghar me na aaye'n,<br>
Ab shakl bhi mujhko na dikhaye'n na dikhaye'n,<br>
Ab sar bhi mere bhai ki qatir na kataye'n,<br>
Rahat ke awaz inse ye sadme hum uthaye'n.<br>
<br>
Mar jayenge to god me lashou ko na lungi,<br>
Mamu une royenge to mai rone na dungi.<br>
____________________________<br>
Fizza hui qaime se rawa'n janibe maida'n,<br>
Kya dekhti hai neher pe hai fouje farawa'n,<br>
Zainab ke jigar goshou pe hai teerou ka baraa'n,<br>
Nagah hua shor ke mushkil hui asaa'n.<br>
<br>
Lo jan o dile duqtare Zehra gaye maare,<br>
Do roz ke pyase labe Dariya gaye mare.